build prefix P of occupied cells
for each empty cell (i,j):
    if a stamp with top-left (i,j) fits (rectangle sum == 0 and inside grid):
        mark (i,j)
build prefix F of marks
for each empty cell (i,j):
    if no mark in window rows [i-h+1..i], cols [j-w+1..j] (clamped to grid):
        return false
return true
